**Alenawe (Early):** *[Not available at Early tier.]*
**Alenawe (Mid):** *[Not available at Mid tier.]*
**Alenawe (Late):** "They confused the long view with the only view. That error scales."

**Followup 1 [Curious] — "Do you still believe in their project?"** [+2]
- Early: *[Not available at Early tier.]*
